<VI _name="RemoteVI Complex Fixture Arrange.vi" description="Build tool of RemoteVI Complex Fixture.vi\3A run it after RemoteVI Complex Fixture Paste.vi\2C with the fixture idle\3B it can be run again (every step sets\2C nothing is added). Lays the panel out\3A each control is moved (GObject Move) into its pane (0 left\2C 1 toolbar\2C 2 main) or into a page of the tab control Settings and placed relative to the pane's visible top-left or to Settings. The toolbar holds Inspector\2C View\2C Stop and Status\2C the left pane Nav\2C Results and Steps (taller than the pane\2C so it scrolls) and the hidden Log Path and error out\2C the main pane Settings\3B page Acquisition holds Channel\2C Rate\2C Level and Data File\2C page Display holds Scope\2C page Viewer (added with Add Page when the tab has two) the subpanel Viewer. Then\3A pages named Acquisition\2C Display and Viewer with fixed 110 px tabs\2C Stop and Inspector switch when released\2C Data File with its browse button\2C Results with column headers and three rows\2C Steps three elements high\2C tip strips on Rate\2C on Gain inside Channel and on Nav\2C the main pane scaling Settings with the pane (Pane Set Scaling\2C Scale Single Object)\2C the window 1180 x 760\3B in View A\2C View B and the inspector (Views) the Quit switches hidden and tip strips set. Saves the fixture and the views. problems lists every row or step that returned an error\2C with its code\3B the run goes on.">
